LangChain + Ollama

LangChain acts as the Agent Brain.

Instead of writing:


if "+" in query:


LangChain decides automatically.


Install

pip install langchain
pip install langchain-community

Verify:


pip list | grep langchain

Project Structure


langchain-agent/
|
├── main.py
└── tools.py

tools.py

def calculator(text):

    return eval(text)


main.py

from langchain.tools import Tool

from tools import calculator

calc_tool = Tool(
    name="Calculator",
    func=calculator,
    description="Useful for math calculations"
)

query = input("Ask: ")

result = calc_tool.run(query)

print(result)

------------

python3 main.py


Input:

Plain Text
10+20

output:

Plain Text
30


