Real LangChain Agent

Now let's connect Ollama.

Install

pip install langchain-ollama

----------


main.py


from langchain_ollama import ChatOllama

llm = ChatOllama(
    model="llama3.2"
)

question = input("Ask: ")

response = llm.invoke(question)

print(response.content)


